    "hour": {
      "_note": "concept_fixture_only: \"Play the next hour\" (WOW-SPEC-3 8.6, flag playHour): 30 steps of two demo minutes on the 2 s demo tick. Every step adds 'every', every third step 'every3'; every 'attempt_every' steps an 'attempt' arrives (receipt pending; the next step's value settles it). 'climb' raises the windows of each listed provider's EFFECTIVE account (after the auto-switch the next account climbs). Resets the demo clock passes start their next window; cooldowns end by the clock; the auto-switch is per provider (d-switch, item 2): each provider follows its own Settings policy (its toggle and switch point; Codex has its own 85% in the Settings fixture, Claude follows the shared 90%), switches only on a fresh reading to the eligible account with the most room, and waits while its tool is busy ('attempts': {provider, tokens, every, from} adds more tools at work; a pending attempt of that provider holds its switch). Overlay only: DATA and Settings never change; Back to now clears it.",
      "steps": 30, "step_min": 2,
      "every": {"spend.month": 0.03, "value.window": 0.03, "tok:claude": 4200, "tok:codex": 2600},
      "every3": {"cache.read": 6000, "cache.saved": 0.01},
